```
Step 10 - Root on hoth through the compiled "colonel" kernel exploit, then a uid 0 backdoor account.
syslog shows the account being created; osquery shows the commands and their effective uid.
```
index=botsv3 host=hoth
    ((sourcetype=syslog "useradd" "new user")
     OR (sourcetype=osquery:results name=pack_process-monitoring_proc_events (colonel OR useradd OR loot OR "x:0:")))
| spath columns.cmdline output=cmd
| spath columns.euid output=euid
| eval what=coalesce(cmd, _raw)
| eval what=replace(what, "(\"-p\" \")[^\"]+", "\1<password removed>")
| eval what=substr(what, 1, 160)
| where NOT like(what, "\"/bin/bash\" \"-c\"%")
| table _time sourcetype euid what
| sort _time
